          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Walking a mile takes about 2,000 to 2,500 steps</strong> for most
            adults and running roughly 1,300 to 1,900. Divide 63,360 by your step length in inches,
            and expect fewer steps if you are taller, faster or running.
          </p>
